264 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 37 0 R/T(Python has no 'const' keyword: any name can be reassigned. The output above shows BASE_RATE = 99 was accepted without any error. The convention \(PEP 8\) of writing constants in UPPER_CASE tells every programmer 'do not change this value', lets reviewers and tools \(linters\) spot accidental changes, and makes the code self-documenting. The protection is by agreement, not by the language.)/E(Python has no 'const' keyword: any name can be reassigned. The output above shows BASE_RATE = 99 was accepted without any error. The convention \(PEP 8\) of writing constants in UPPER_CASE tells every programmer 'do not change this value', lets reviewers and tools \(linters\) spot accidental changes, and makes the code self-documenting. The protection is by agreement, not by the language.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[24]>>
endobj

