<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 40 0 R/T(5. try / except ValueError: read_float\(\) above keeps asking until float\(\) succeeds. Note: float\(\) also accepts '1e2', '-3', 'nan' and 'inf', so range checks \(and a math.isfinite test, used in calculator.py in Task 9\) are still needed. 6. f-string formatting: {amount:8.2f} = width 8, 2 decimals, right-aligned \(output above shows | 283.90|\).)/E(5. try / except ValueError: read_float\(\) above keeps asking until float\(\) succeeds. Note: float\(\) also accepts '1e2', '-3', 'nan' and 'inf', so range checks \(and a math.isfinite test, used in calculator.py in Task 9\) are still needed. 6. f-string formatting: {amount:8.2f} = width 8, 2 decimals, right-aligned \(output above shows | 283.90|\).)/Pg 16 0 R/K[5]>>
