<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 41 0 R/T(All three are O\(n\) time and O\(1\) extra space and give the same total \(35,799,600.00\). Function-call overhead is real but tiny \(about 2 ms out of 78 ms for 100,000 entries, about 3%\), so the maintainability benefits of functions far outweigh it.)/E(All three are O\(n\) time and O\(1\) extra space and give the same total \(35,799,600.00\). Function-call overhead is real but tiny \(about 2 ms out of 78 ms for 100,000 entries, about 3%\), so the maintainability benefits of functions far outweigh it.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[9]>>
