<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 43 0 R/T(1. Stages of algorithmic problem-solving. Understand: read the problem, identify inputs, outputs, rules, constraints and examples \(Task 1\). Plan: design the steps in pseudocode/flowchart, decide data types and test examples before coding. Write: implement the plan in Python using functions and constants. Test: run normal, boundary and invalid cases, compare with hand-calculated answers, fix errors and repeat.)/E(1. Stages of algorithmic problem-solving. Understand: read the problem, identify inputs, outputs, rules, constraints and examples \(Task 1\). Plan: design the steps in pseudocode/flowchart, decide data types and test examples before coding. Write: implement the plan in Python using functions and constants. Test: run normal, boundary and invalid cases, compare with hand-calculated answers, fix errors and repeat.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[7]>>
