<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 49 0 R/T(Still appropriate: named constants \(concept\), the separate module, the small functions \(rate_per_litre, payout, ten_day_total\), range validation, rounding each payment, the automated tests. No longer appropriate: a single set of rate constants, whole-step rounding, float arithmetic, and a ten_day_total without bonus/season. The design structure is sound, so a modification \(not a complete redesign\) is justified.)/E(Still appropriate: named constants \(concept\), the separate module, the small functions \(rate_per_litre, payout, ten_day_total\), range validation, rounding each payment, the automated tests. No longer appropriate: a single set of rate constants, whole-step rounding, float arithmetic, and a ten_day_total without bonus/season. The design structure is sound, so a modification \(not a complete redesign\) is justified.)/Pg 25 0 R/K[8]>>
